{"id":"wb-6-543","name":"寿昌桥","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"壽昌橋","text":"寿昌桥是浙江省湖州市德清县境内的一座古桥，位于德清县二都瓦窑自然村。又名上渚桥，为南宋咸淳间(1265年—1274年)县人姚智所建。寿昌桥于1989年12月被浙江省人民政府公布列为浙江省省级文物保护单位，2006年5月被国务院列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A3%BD%E6%98%8C%E6%A9%8B","revisionId":92157979,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92157979","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/0b4bb0d3e2b07231922365a7.jpg","title":"Shouchang_Bridge,_2020-11-14_03.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Shouchang_Bridge,_2020-11-14_03.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/59/Shouchang_Bridge%2C_2020-11-14_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​德清寿昌桥","width":320,"height":214}}